{"id":"d052b2bc0fd1af00","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation.md","title":"epsilon free gnf notation","display":"df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation — epsilon free gnf notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation","display":"df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation — epsilon free gnf notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-notation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation","73-definition-4.6"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"Theorem 4.6, pp. 95–97; local normal-form interfaces","source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_numbering":"local-catalog; not book numbering","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.6, pp. 95–97; local normal-form interfaces","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation — epsilon free gnf notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation</span><span>73-definition-4.6</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.6, pp. 95–97; local normal-form interfaces"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.6, pp. 95–97; local normal-form interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\">\\(G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in T\">\\(a\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in V^*\">\\(\\beta\\in V^*\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{GNF}\\)</span> 保留原文没有空词分支的版本；在固定文法上下文中，产生式短写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to a\\beta\">\\(A\\to a\\beta\\)</span> 是下述关系记号，不是无条件断言某条规则存在。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>类定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 是所量化的文法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\Sigma\">\\(T=\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a> 已固定的终结字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,P,S\">\\(V,P,S\\)</span> 在各个文法见证内重新绑定。类的载体限定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CFG}\">\\(\\mathrm{CFG}\\)</span>，不由环境中某一固定文法的分量决定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GNF}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{H\\in\\mathrm{CFG}:\n\\exists V,P,S\\;\\bigl(H=(V,T,P,S)\\land\\bigl(\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\n\\exists a\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;\\alpha=a\\beta\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GNF}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{H\\in\\mathrm{CFG}:\n\\exists V,P,S\\;\\bigl(H=(V,T,P,S)\\land\\bigl(\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\n\\exists a\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;\\alpha=a\\beta\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\nG\\in\\mathrm{GNF}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\exists a\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;\\alpha=a\\beta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\nG\\in\\mathrm{GNF}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\exists a\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;\\alpha=a\\beta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\n(A\\to a\\beta)\\leftrightarrow(A,a\\beta)\\in P\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\n(A\\to a\\beta)\\leftrightarrow(A,a\\beta)\\in P\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>不添加标准扩展版本可能允许的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\to\\varepsilon\">\\(S\\to\\varepsilon\\)</span>；保留原定义实际指向的文法类。</p>\n<p>新增的类构造与原有效文法上的成员判据一致；原成员判据继续保留。没有增加起始符号不出现在右部的限制，也没有改动任何产生式分支。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}$，见 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]；$A\\in V$、$a\\in T$、$\\beta\\in V^*$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"类定义中的 $H$ 是所量化的文法；$T=\\Sigma$ 是 [[73-df-cfg-notation]] 已固定的终结字母表，$V,P,S$ 在各个文法见证内重新绑定。类的载体限定为 $\\mathrm{CFG}$，不由环境中某一固定文法的分量决定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in V^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GNF}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to a\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"V,P,S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CFG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GNF}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{H\\in\\mathrm{CFG}:\n\\exists V,P,S\\;\\bigl(H=(V,T,P,S)\\land\\bigl(\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\n\\exists a\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;\\alpha=a\\beta\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\nG\\in\\mathrm{GNF}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\\exists a\\in T\\;\\exists\\beta\\in V^*\\;\\alpha=a\\beta","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.6}\\vdash\n(A\\to a\\beta)\\leftrightarrow(A,a\\beta)\\in P","display":true},{"tex":"S\\to\\varepsilon","display":false}],"bytes":2546,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-378","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation|epsilon free gnf notation]]"},{"id":"b1945eaeb0e1f49f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-language-class]]。带开始符号空词例外的 $\\operatorname{GNF}$ 见 [[73-df-standard-gnf]]；仅含 $A\\to a\\beta$ 的旧 $\\mathrm{GNF}$ 见 [[73-df-epsilon-free-gnf-notation]]，均取同一 $\\Sigma$。"}],"outgoing":["c0217e1a08a868eb"]}